+ version: 1.0.2
+ ```bash
+ ```
+ **Symptoms:** "--version must be valid semver" error (sometimes even when SKILL.md has a version)
+ **Solution:** Use proper semver: "1.0.0", "2.2.0" (not "2.2") and pass it explicitly at publish time:
+ clawhub publish /path/to/skill --version 1.0.0 --changelog "Your notes"
+ This avoids CLI parsing edge cases in `clawhub` 0.9.0.